nd and generalised the sects are in v5. You can theoretically run the Sabbat stuff as anarchs but that just leads on the a differant issue. You're either running diet sabbat which damns and the sect your playing with faint praise since it implies theyre utterly bland non entities or you're effectively running them as Sabbat which makes the Sabbat ban absurd<br /> .<br /> <br /> yep and that's why I can't stand v5 carmarilla as a primary ivory tower player. They've taken a complex intriguing organization and stripped it all distinction to the point you can run basically the Sabbat in it.<br /> <br /> Its like the difference between a gourmet burger from a restaurant were its specialty and the burger which you can get at at general restaurant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 05-07-2023, 03:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T12:37:32-07:00","id":1511011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1510989#post1510989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ask yourself the following question: Is there anything on the Sabbat that could be from some morally questionable/offensive angle or relatable to some hateful group even if in a forced way, which I won't say which because I don't want to get in trouble. I'm going to say yes and that's a loophole for someone to make a legal process.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If a decade of satanic panic was not enough to harm ttrpgs like DnD. How could potential offense open a legal leeway?<br /> <br /> In warhammer 40K, over a dozen genocidal factions are absolutly playable and marketed as such.<br /> <br /> In many historical wargames or video games, nazi germany is a playable faction. And in fps games, you can play terrorists.<br /> <br /> The only way to have any problem would be to name a real living person in a pretty bad light, and even that would depend on the local nation's laws on the right parody.<br /> <br /> Playing the sabbat is no worse than playing an army of dark eldars ready to take away slaves for their torture pits. Or the alien main character in the video game Kill all humans.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T13:05:13-07:00","id":1511012,"title":"","content":"Last I heard, the Nazis were still a playable faction in the Hearts of Iron games. In fact many real world historic atrocities, and any more a player feels like inventing and throwing in on the way, are all up for grabs in Paradox's historical strategy games. The WoD is a game that highlights all the evil shit humanity has ever done, is doing and will do; VtM in particular is about being in a situation that pushes you to embrace that evil shit; and Paradox is a company that has made and published aforementioned historical strategy games who intentionally bought said grimdark IP. Paradox is one of the absolute last companies I'm going to take seriously on the claim &quot;oh no, we can't do that. Too dark. We can't reference<i> real life evil </i>in fiction or let people play fucked up villains.&quot; (Which I am not saying they claimed, I don't know of any such incident, simply that the idea does not hold water.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T13:23:51-07:00","id":1511014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511007#post1511007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> It can sort of be farmed out but that's more about how bland and generalised the sects are in v5. You can theoretically run the Sabbat stuff as anarchs but that just leads on the a differant issue. You're either running diet sabbat which damns and the sect your playing with faint praise since it implies theyre utterly bland non entities or you're effectively running them as Sabbat which makes the Sabbat ban absurd<br /> .<br /> <br /> yep and that's why I can't stand v5 carmarilla as a primary ivory tower player. They've taken a complex intriguing organization and stripped it all distinction to the point you can run basically the Sabbat in it.<br /> <br /> Its like the difference between a gourmet burger from a restaurant were its specialty and the burger which you can get at at general restaurant.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, Very Much Agreed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T14:12:41-07:00","id":1511016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511004#post1511004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> no it isn't, throwing other members of the community under the bus aside from being an appalling attitude is self defeating. Since you'll end up with a hallowed out parody of a game. Continuation of the ip at that stage is meaningless.<br /> <br /> also legal? Do you mean commercial?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I mean legal, process/fine depends of the case. And in this case what I meant is that if there is a risk of there being an offense lawsuit, they will lose money due to fines, and they will still have to make these changes later, which would still piss off the fans, making the changes earlier. they at least get rid of the process and the loss is mitigated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T14:19:04-07:00","id":1511017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1510991#post1510991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Allow me to point out that you're talking about a game where you're playing a bloodsucking manipulative monstrosity that murders hundreds for food and pleasure while turning ordinary humans into addicted pets. That's of course before turning into a wilted callous thing that treats everything in existence as pawns for the express purpose of self aggrandizement . There's more than enough shit for anyone to call this out just for that yet the game is still out.<br /> <br /> If you wanted to play it safe, you wouldn't be pushing these games out.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know this is ridiculous, but for you to offend some creed or group, these days at least, causes far more trouble than violence and blood, so I keep my argument.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T14:22:19-07:00","id":1511018,"title":"","content":"Look, I already saw that I moved the wasp's nest a little more than I should, so, unless the ADM releases me to speak, I better stop here because I don't want to be banned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T14:44:50-07:00","id":1511021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511016#post1511016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, I mean legal, process/fine depends of the case. And in this case what I meant is that if there is a risk of there being an offense lawsuit, they will lose money due to fines, and they will still have to make these changes later, which would still piss off the fans, making the changes earlier. they at least get rid of the process and the loss is mitigated.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a pretty paranoid fantasy to indulge, and it falls apart when you look up any cases that would actually be useful for trying to establish the precedent you'd need to reach this conclusion, nevermind that Paradox kind of shot themselves in the foot in having a franchise large enough to even garner the sort of shitstorm you're fretting about, and again* this assumes there'd even be a shitstorm about it.<br /> <br /> *can't wait for that other post to get reapproved <hr />Taking this as a second to indulge the actual point of the thread, it occurs to me that this particular declaration of the old World of Darkness being done is both woefully late to the party and overly doomsaying. A lot of the reasons why it's reasonable to say we're seeing a franchise crash is honestly all stuff that was getting called out from pretty nearly the beginning, and while it's surprising how magnified some of those problems got, the core of the shitshow has always been there and called out. This was a rough patch that could have been avoided, and wasn't. THe Old World, from one perspective, has been done a lot longer than this.<br /> <br /> By contrast, the doomsaying is a little misplaced. I think it definitely missed the window to become re-relevant to the mainstream discourse, and unless there's a real trick in Paradox's pocket, we may be entering into a period of time where the brand will have to go quiet for a while to heal up it's PR and community faith. That said, all of the original nostalgia and faith that made World of Darkness tantalizing as a property to pick up are still there, and a lot of those themes that made it relevant in the 90s still exist here, albeit in new forms. I would wager that any iteration of World of Darkness after Paradox's try is definitely going to be in the do or die position, but I think there's demonstrably still enough demand and faith in the franchise to <i>warrant</i> that next iteration.<br /> <br /> And, well, while Paradox traditionally has flubbed their handling, the likelihood that they are not in a position where they're just trying to recoup the costs of getting the franchise as opposed to growing into the new hotness means we're in a position where interesting and novel attempts have room to happen and potentially flourish-after all, there's only so many more ways to go down left, and because of that's there's quite a lot of ways to go up. While I don't think that likely, it can't quite be closed out.<br /> <br /> So, like, yeah, I'm surprised certain parties held as long as they did, but I think the fact that certain parties held out as long as they did indicates there's still at least a little more future for the franchise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T14:54:04-07:00","id":1511022,"title":"","content":"I mean the Sabbat are a highly organised ( at the top end) group of revolutionaries with surface level religious trappings who use their brainwashed junior members as disposable chess pieces in their war against ancient God Things and their Ivory Tower pawns.<br /> <br /> Are you worried about a lawsuit from IS? Or Qanon? Balochistan Liberation Army? Jamaa