con b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know this is ridiculous, but for you to offend some creed or group, these days at least, causes far more trouble than violence and blood, so I keep my argument.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511018#post1511018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Look, I already saw that I moved the wasp's nest a little more than I should, so, unless the ADM releases me to speak, I better stop here because I don't want to be banned.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have no idea what you're talking about. I'm not even sure you're sure what you're talking about. For all the missteps Paradox may have done while rebuilding the brand they did not at any point end up in legal problems. Practically all of their problems are either problems in communication or flat out Public Image gaffes where they tried to be cool and hip about something and ended up offensive in generating strong public relations.<br /> <br /> The only court the IP has issues with right now is the one of public opinion. And no matter what kind of thematic or narrative conflicts parts of the fanbase may have about which of <i>their</i> products is superior, that's irrelevant to the corporate entity who has to worry that their brand is safe and secure and that it's image isn't tarnished by stupid PR gaffes.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes yo