theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T17:56:33-07:00","id":1511035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511032#post1511032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> TL;DR: The reason you're paranoid about getting banned by saying what you're thinking is because the thing you're thinking is a mean-spirited charicature doing cartoon villainy, that's pretty well divorced from reality in terms of what's actually doable and who the people you're talking about are like, and you know that well enough to not want to say it.<br /> <br /> With the bonus of &quot;The people you're thinking of, admittedly, have less of the poltically associated motives to play World than they did in the 90s&quot;<br /> <br /> Or, even shorter, You do realize the boogeyman doesn't exist, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Two things.<br /> 1. Internet, I suppose everyone is sensitive like an abomination embraced by a Brujah, with derangement prone to tantrums.<br /> 2. I don't know how it works where you live, but here everyone takes advantage of the coup as they can, those on the right and left are killing each other, LITERALLY, and are even seen as heroes.<br /> <br /> That said, as much as I liked the analogy, I can't agree with it. Call me paranoid if you want, for me it's a compliment, it even helps me, I work well. As Forest G would say. &quot;I don't want to talk about it anymore&quot; I'm tired and I remembered things I didn't want to remember.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T18:03:53-07:00","id":1511036,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=ArcaneArts;n1511026].<br /> .<br /> <br /> The reason you're worried about getting a ban openly talking about the political forces that factor into what may or may not happen with World going forward is rooted in the same things that has overblown your reaction reaction to &quot;the woke left&quot; in this situation.<br /> ]<br /> <br /> <br /> To be fair with him on that specific point, his prudence seems waranted here. The mods of the forum have shown a certain tendancy to abuse the ban hammer, notably on matters of political discussion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T18:26:14-07:00","id":1511037,"title":"","content":"Ok, as Psicose seems to be posting from a literal warzone a little paranoia perhaps comes with the territory. If they are not posting from an actual conflict zone then I have no idea what any of their posts are about.<br /> <br /> However it has no bearing whatsoever on Tabletop RPG games made in the US and Sweden. Which I think is where the disconnect in communication is for me.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T18:30:35-07:00","id":1511038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511029#post1511029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay... let's do it this way: what does the vampire do on the Sabbat?</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampire things. They do rituals. They conduct raids and warfare on Camarilla territories. They secure territory of their own. Go on archaeological expeditions to find clues to the locations of ancient vampires. Hunt down infernalists.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T19:29:11-07:00","id":1511039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511036#post1511036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair with him on that specific point, his prudence seems waranted here. The mods of the forum have shown a certain tendancy to abuse the ban hammer, notably on matters of political discussion</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking as someone who has been banned for both political takes and not-political takes*, and has also <i>not</i> been banned while doing both, it's not the politics, it's being an asshole about or with them.<br /> <br /> ANYHOW, having called the demon by it's name, getting back on track-while the Sabbat's particular expression is definitely more extreme than, say, the Empire in Star Wars, in terms of the overall role, they're about in the same place, and their execution and details are the sort of thing RPG consent forms are designed to handle. There's a market for &quot;Rated R/18+&quot; material so long as it's, you know, rated R/18+ and handled appropriately as such. If there's a reason why that would have an impact on the sales and engagement with the property, it's honestly more that something being <i>daaaaaaaark</i>** is less of a draw for the general audience than you'd think, and less moral crusades being deliberately taken.<br /> <br /> *I mean, everything is political, so perhaps &quot;more directly political and less directly political.&quot;<br /> *<i>heaaaaart!</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T23:15:37-07:00","id":1511047,"title":"","content":"Vampire, like, isn't offensive, beyond some clans originally being racist caricatures and Vykos being the trans representative, maybe a few other details we can skip over. Everything about vampire is punching up, and there's enough &quot;myth&quot; and &quot;we're playing vampires&quot; and &quot;it's satire&quot; that there's nothing really sue worthy, and if you're offending the &quot;we praise jesus but ignore his words&quot; crowd, like, that's standard fair. <br /> Werewolf is admittedly difficult, but there is a pretty clear path towards making it easier<br /> Mage, in it's heart, is not so bad. Probably between the Vampire and werewolf, but ultimately something that could be very respectful with a little more care. <br /> <br /> As a young millennial with friends and students on all sides, I don't think people are overly sensitive today to the point where you can't be spicy. It's a bad caricature. Maybe the elderly set in their ways might be shocked that the youth don't respond well when they say certain things, but for someone paying attention or at least practiced in arguing it's quite easy to learn where the boundaries of taste are. Generally speaking If you don't make a statement in ignorance you're going to do fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T00:18:56-07:00","id":1511053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511029#post1511029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Okay... let's do it this way: what does the vampire do on the Sabbat?</div> </div> </div> </div> Drink blood and kill people.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T00:20:00-07:00","id":1511054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511030#post1511030\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Know some people who would think that's great.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes and those people should be ignored and your approach would directly empower them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T02:01:16-07:00","id":1511057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511047#post1511047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As a young millennial with friends and students on all sides, I don't think people are overly sensitive today to the point where you can't be spicy. It's a bad caricature. Maybe the elderly set in their ways might be shocked that the youth don't respond well when they say certain things, but for someone paying attention or at least practiced in arguing it's quite easy to learn where the boundaries of taste are. Generally speaking If you don't make a statement in ignorance you're going to do fine.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think their are certainly bad takes out their. Certain people will use the portrayal of socially conscious activity to engage in toxic behaviour. Furthermore theirs no reason you can't simply be stupid while also being good intentioned or mistake your (subjective) understanding of a sociological issue as somehow a moral mandate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 05-08-2023, 05:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T06:17:28-07:00","id":1511070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1509297-old-world-of-darkness-is-officially-done?p=1511057#post1511057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I think their are certainly bad takes out their. Certain people will use the portrayal of socially conscious activity to engage in toxic behaviour. Furthermore theirs no reason you can't simply be stupid while also being good intentioned or mistake your (subjective) understanding of a sociological issue as somehow a moral mandate.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're using a professional and paying them enough, you shouldn't be stupid (or like, you should be paid a lot of money to be stupid. There are plenty of grifters who know what they're doing.) <br /> <br /> Also like, if you don't know enough about something, or you know too much and what you do know is a bit too spicy, it's perfectly reasonable to leave something alone, to limit yourself to what anyone educated would consider well founded, or to use the classic and of-late underutilized principle of show-not-tell without tastelessly contriving a scenario just for that purpose. A professional writer shouldn't just be thoughtlessly whacking away half baked ideas like I'm doing now, you can't treat something you've been commissioned to write as something where you should just avoid due diligence. Especially given the satirical aspect of WoD, which should challenge the audience, you <i>must</i> include spice. <br /> <br /> Also the types who &quot;use socially conscious activity to engage in toxic behaviour&quot; are generally pretty silent when the end product is good, a few of the more centered critics will actually praise a well done socially conscious work. It's only &quot;woke&quot; when it's bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.t